WEBVTT

00:04:58.436 --> 00:05:00.756
a stakeholder to the climate goals.

00:05:01.316 --> 00:05:02.556
Our climate budget,

00:05:02.596 --> 00:05:06.756
which is measured in tons
of CO2 emissions,

00:05:06.796 --> 00:05:10.116
is fully integrated
in the municipal budget.

00:05:10.876 --> 00:05:13.396
And like the financial budget,

00:05:13.436 --> 00:05:19.556
the climate budget is the responsibility
of the deputy mayor of finance.

00:05:20.316 --> 00:05:23.516
It presents the expected
emission reduction

00:05:23.556 --> 00:05:26.556
from the adopted climate measures.

00:05:26.596 --> 00:05:30.316
And it clearly states what has to be done